G0 APPROVE eligible with CONDITIONAL R1 note. MTF EMA using iMA with explicit PERIOD_H1 from M15 chart is MT5-native. Bar-synchronization note: H1 bar must be fully closed when reading — use shift 0 with care or read H1 at shift 1 (previous completed H1 bar). P1 must handle MTF bar alignment correctly.

## Pipeline history
