## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- H1 filter: `double h1_ema5 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,5,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)` — use shift 1 (last completed H1 bar)
- H1 filter: `double h1_ema100 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,100,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- M15 entry: `double m15_ema5_1 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M15,5,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- M15 entry: `double m15_ema100_1 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_M15,100,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- H1 condition: `h1_ema5 > h1_ema100` (bullish H1)
- M15 cross: detect up cross on bar[1] vs bar[2]
- SL: 15 pips; TP: 30 pips
- P3 sweeps: EMA periods (5/100 vs 8/100 vs 5/50), H1 filter strict (EMA5 > EMA100 by ≥5 pips), SL/TP (10/20 vs 15/30 pips)

